  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safety, Access, Dignifying and Inclusive (SADI) Training for staff and partners in S/L and Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recent suspension of CAFOD CHS certification and the concern over safeguarding within the charity sector has occasioned CAFOD to develop the safety, access, dignity and inclusive programming framework. This training would be for key CAFOD staff and partners programme staff, so as to better equip them in implementing safe, accessible, dignified and inclusive programme within the emergency and long-term development programming.</narrative>
  </description>
